      "title": "Reapply the current range when the first series is added",
      "description": "The visible-range effect reads `seriesCountRef.current`, but changing that ref in the facade\u2019s `addSeries`/`removeSeries` callbacks does not trigger a render. If a series is added after the chart is ready, the current range is therefore not applied until the range changes for some other reason. The translation test only changes the range *after* adding a series, so it does not cover this case.",
